{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/48","id":4686743740,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTfIvP88AAAABF1oIvA","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/48","diff_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/48.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/48.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/issues/48","number":48,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Record unresolved four-manifold perfectness transfer obstructions (2961)","user":{"login":"AlecKriebel","id":6109370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6109370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"KP-4.85 remains unresolved: this package does not construct a closed orientable smooth four-manifold whose full diffeomorphism identity component has unbounded commutator length. After two approaches, it records an ambient four-commutator bound for the stabilized subgroup f×id on M×S², following classical compression, and the exact obstruction to direct invariant-measure averaging. Neither subgroup, covering-group nor fragmentation conclusions are substituted for the target.\n\nThe source audit corrects the scope of existing uniform-perfectness results and identifies 30004403 / OWR-17471-009 as the same target. No novelty is claimed.\n\nValidation: 6,570 exact author assertions reproduce byte for byte. A separate adversarial AI review passed the scoped deductions and source audit, with 228 independent exact controls and no mandatory corrections. The report and reproducible checks are included; this has not undergone human peer review. Only this problem’s attempt folder is changed.\n\nDisposition: unsolved / stalled, 2 of 5 substantive approaches used. The duplicate target should share this outcome.\n","created_at":"2026-09-30T06:28:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T06:30:07Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e6ef4f3e485fd360575358127c2734a8ced90d93","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/48/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/48/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/issues/48/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/statuses/e2e5c8c3e5ad218f867fa753c465bb96b3687bda","head":{"label":"AlecKriebel:dot/math-2961","ref":"dot/math-2961","sha":"e2e5c8c3e5ad218f867fa753c465bb96b3687bda","user":{"login":"AlecKriebel","id":6109370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6109370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc